WEBVTT

00:00:29.984 --> 00:00:32.111
put it into that laptop
and we huddled around

00:00:32.111 --> 00:00:34.697
and played the match to end all matches.

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:39.035
We played so many more matches after that,

00:00:39.077 --> 00:00:42.330
but neither of us became
professional footballers.

00:00:42.371 --> 00:00:43.790
Richard?

00:00:43.831 --> 00:00:44.999
He's a lawyer.

00:00:44.999 --> 00:00:47.752
Me, I work with data

00:00:47.794 --> 00:00:51.923
to go and help organizations
get that competitive edge and win.

00:00:52.465 --> 00:00:57.053
Back in '95, that game
was just a video game.

00:00:57.095 --> 00:00:58.221
Nothing more.

00:00:58.679 --> 00:01:02.183
Little did we know
that in the years to come